BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0 g 72 482.07 Td (Neural language models have become the default tool for a wide range of text) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0 g 72 467.58 Td (understanding problems. This question has become central as models are deployed on longer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0 g 72 453.09 Td (and more heterogeneous inputs, and as practitioners weigh accuracy against cost.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0 g 72 432.30 Td (Clinical notes differ from general-domain text in vocabulary, abbreviation density, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0 g 72 417.81 Td (document length; a typical discharge summary in MIMIC-III exceeds 1,500 word pieces, far) Tj ET
